Adapt netdata v2.12.0 collectors for the prometheus v0.311.3 labels API.
https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/releases/tag/v0.311.3
https://github.com/netdata/netdata/tree/v2.12.0
CVE-2026-42151, CVE-2026-42154, and CVE-2026-44903 require prometheus >= v0.311.3. Upstream still pins v0.302.0. The module replace is applied by the go/bump step, not this patch.
